cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "quota_marriage: Gender Quotas in Local Government and Marriage Outcomes at Census Scale"
abstract: >-
  Tests whether childhood exposure to female-reserved Gram Panchayat pradhan
  seats changes women's marriage timing and spousal age gap, using parsed
  Indian electoral rolls covering 173 million adults in Rajasthan and Uttar
  Pradesh. Placebo cohorts with zero exposure reproduce much of the estimated
  effect, so the design does not support a causal claim.
